Mechanisms: unit-normal chord reconstruction; positive ordinary-distance antipedal linear solve; global tangent-branch/reflection analysis; exact short/long/horizontal chord controls; small simple/star/reversed/repeated closed-cycle reconstruction; excluded backtracking and hyperbolic controls; singular-caustic boundary examination.

