Public payload excludes `private_source_extracts/` in full. This contains copyrighted extracted primary-source text and rendered pages. `PRIVATE_SOURCE_ARTIFACT_PINS.json` records their exact bytes/SHA256 and why they are private. Primary PDFs remain outside this folder and are not copied or redistributed. Review payload/seal excludes its closing envelope (`OUTPUT_MANIFEST.json`, `SEAL_RECEIPT.json`, and the actual final sealing-process receipt directory); that closing receipt supplies observed process exit/custody after the manifest is written.
